@startuml
actor Kullanici
boundary "Mobil Uygulama" as Mobile
control "Appointment API" as API
entity "Veterinary Service" as VetService
database "MongoDB Atlas" as DB
collections "FCM Service" as FCM

Kullanici -> Mobile : Veteriner sec ve randevu iste
Mobile -> API : POST /appointments
API -> VetService : Musait slot kontrolu
VetService -> DB : Veteriner ve takvim verisini sorgula
DB --> VetService : Musait slotlar
VetService --> API : Slot uygun
API -> DB : Randevu kaydini olustur
DB --> API : appointmentId, status=pending
API -> FCM : Veterinere bildirim gonder
FCM --> API : Bildirim sonucu
API --> Mobile : 201 Created
Mobile --> Kullanici : Randevu olusturuldu
@enduml
